@title Cooler layout without a plate: the Cabinet says why and keeps saying it
@area Heat
# A search asked for where the Cabinet has nothing to search on (no panel, or no plate yet) is dropped. The empty state names the reason and the sentence stays on screen, not for one frame.
fresh
key ctrl+n
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
expect "No panel yet"
shot no-plate
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text cooler layout
wait 8
key Enter
wait 20
expect "Cooler layout needs a plate"
shot says-why
wait 20
expect "Cooler layout needs a plate"
shot still-says-why
check_layout
